From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mmc: allwinner: add the A733 eMMC (HS400) compatible

The A733 eMMC controller (SMHC2) gets its own compatible + driver cfg so only
that instance enables HS400 (the SD controller stays on sun20i-d1-mmc). Add
allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc to the binding, with allwinner,sun20i-d1-mmc as the
fallback the driver also matches, so a kernel without the A733 entry still binds
(without HS400). Needed for dtbs_check once the eMMC DT node is armed.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mmc/allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc.yaml
@@ -58,6 +58,9 @@
       - items:
           - const: allwinner,sun55i-a523-mmc
           - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-mmc
+      - items:
+          - const: allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc
+          - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-mmc
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
